{"id":"5351fa2ed7f7385a","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Cofinality Meager Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number — ZFC CI Cofinality Meager Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number — ZFC CI Cofinality Meager Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-meager]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number — ZFC CI Cofinality Meager Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"58-df-meager\">58-df-meager</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology\">../batch14/58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (ambient topological space and topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (meager ideal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (candidate cofinality)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}\\)</span> (meager-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"58-df-meager\">58-df-meager</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology\">../batch14/58-df-topology</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Meager}(A,X,\\tau)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal M\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\subseteq B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Meager}(A,X,\\tau)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal M\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\subseteq B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology parameter is explicit and now required to satisfy the topology predicate before the meager ideal and its cofinality are formed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-meager","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-meager]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-meager","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Meager}$ (meager-set predicate, see [[58-df-meager]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$ (topology predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Meager}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\min C","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiCofinalityMeagerNumber}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathcal M=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\mathrm{Meager}(A,X,\\tau)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal M\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\subseteq B)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ecb3b4164c43d4b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1603","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number.md|58-df-zfc-ci-cofinality-meager-number]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","315ad00b8744fdfc","d816c9cae96d1191","5fb1c2241d1943d1","e7514bc4cefba4f2","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5